             PGM
/*****************************************************************/
/*** PROGRAM: L01CHG                                           ***/
/*** PURPOSE: TO SUBMIT JOBS TO CHANGE THE CSIS/MMIS DATA BASE ***/
/***          FILES (PHYSICAL AND LOGICAL) FOR THE L01 RELEASE.***/
/***                                                           ***/
/***          THIS PROGRAM WILL SUBMIT   2 (TWO)  JOBS (FOR    ***/
/***          SUBSET OF CSIS/MMIS) WITH A JOBD AND USER OF     ***/
/***          PD01.                                            ***/
/*****************************************************************/

             SBMJOB     CMD(CALL PGM(MCPRD/L01STORES)) +
                          JOB(L01STORES) JOBD(PD01) USER(PD01)

             SBMJOB     CMD(CALL PGM(MCPRD/L01MMISA)) +
                          JOB(L01MMISA) JOBD(PD01) USER(PD01)

